prete\/subvention-compostage\/<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"4nk4d\" data-offset-key=\"f5mut-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"f5mut-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"f5mut-0-0\">Il n\u2019est plus possible de faire sa demande au format papier sauf pour le compostage collectif.<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"4nk4d\" data-offset-key=\"f6ov0-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"f6ov0-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"f6ov0-0-0\">\u00a0<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"4nk4d\" data-offset-key=\"7g7dr-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"7g7dr-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"7g7dr-0-0\">Une permanence vous permettra de vous faire accompagner dans toutes vos d\u00e9marches en ligne:<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"4nk4d\" data-offset-key=\"7omcf-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"7omcf-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"7omcf-0-0\">https:\/\/data.strasbourg.eu\/explore\/dataset\/cnfs\/custom\/<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\ud83d\uddb1 Les modalit\u00e9s de demande de subvention par les usagers \u00e9voluent.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":7481,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-date":0,"_expiration-date-type":"","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":[]},"categories":[31,300],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7480"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6"}